  characterName: Tikkle
  icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: db926aa84b1686443b12f84e2a988cb7, type: 3}
  age: 0
  gender: 1
  birthdate: 
  appearance: "Olive green peel with lighter shades. Ulls grans, daurats y Brilliants,
    que s\u2019il\xB7luminen lleugerament a la foscor. Cabells despentinats collected
    in a munt of trains decorated with claus, ampoule taps and filferros. He carries
    a feta armilla of remains of human stolen goods, always full of butxaques."
  personalityTraits: 0600000003000000
  motivations: She wants to understand human behavior through what they abandon.
    She admires humans because deep down she would like to be their friend, but they
    often reject her or don't understand her.
  background: "Tikkle grew up on the edge of the forest, in a goblin community that
    rejected the outside world. But she was always drawn to human cities and their
    \u201Clost totems.\u201D One day she found a half-burnt book on human psychology,
    and from then on she became obsessed with understanding what makes humans laugh,
    cry, get angry, or go crazy.\r\n\r\nShe began sneaking into towns at night, picking
    up objects from dumpsters, watching families through windows, and taking notes
    in her \u201Chuman behavior notebook,\u201D filled with drawings and crazy but
    tender theories."
  speechStyle: 1
  otherInfo: 
